tm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她在爱尔兰乐队中演奏小提琴</span></p><p begin="2.756" end="5.098" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2.756" end="2.864">But</span> <span begin="2.864" end="3.029">she</span> <span begin="3.029" end="3.302">fell</span> <span begin="3.302" end="3.589">in</span> <span begin="3.589" end="3.967">love</span> <span begin="3.967" end="4.143">with</span> <span begin="4.143" end="4.308">an</span> <span begin="4.308" end="4.851">English</span> <span begin="4.851" end="5.098">man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">却与一个英国男人共谱恋曲</span></p><p begin="5.409" end="7.566" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="5.409" end="5.587">Kissed</span> <span begin="5.587" end="5.753">her</span> <span begin="5.753" end="5.912">on</span> <span begin="5.912" end="6.044">the</span> <span begin="6.044" end="6.197">neck</span> <span begin="6.197" end="6.347">and</span> <span begin="6.347" end="6.476">then</span> <span begin="6.476" end="6.632">I</span> <span begin="6.632" end="6.818">took</span> <span begin="6.818" end="6.950">her</span> <span begin="6.950" end="7.155">by</span> <span begin="7.155" end="7.278">the</span> <span begin="7.278" end="7.566">hand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我亲吻着他的香颈 然后握住她的手</span></p><p begin="7.566" end="9.389" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.566" end="7.693">Said,</span> <span begin="7.693" end="8.137">&quot;Baby,</span> <span begin="8.137" end="8.293">I</span> <span begin="8.293" end="8.498">just</span> <span begin="8.498" end="9.068">wanna</span> <span begin="9.068" end="9.389">dance&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">说亲爱的我想要跳舞了</span></p></div><div begin="9.541" end="28.980" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="9.541" end="12.181" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="9.541" end="9.667">I</span> <span begin="9.667" end="9.868">met</span> <span begin="9.868" end="9.980">her</span> <span begin="9.980" end="10.235">on</span> <span begin="10.235" end="10.772">Grafton</span> <span begin="10.772" end="11.096">Street</span> <span begin="11.096" end="11.404">right</span> <span begin="11.404" end="11.704">outside</span> <span begin="11.704" end="11.807">of</span> <span begin="11.807" end="11.960">the</span> <span begin="11.960" end="12.181">bar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我在格拉夫顿街酒吧外面遇见了她</span></p><p begin="12.291" end="14.591" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="12.291" end="12.397">She</span> <span begin="12.397" end="12.577">shared</span> <span begin="12.577" end="12.687">a</span> <span begin="12.687" end="13.137">cigarette</span> <span begin="13.137" end="13.263">with</span> <span begin="13.263" end="13.431">me</span> <span begin="13.431" end="13.563">while</span> <span begin="13.563" end="13.689">her</span> <span begin="13.689" end="13.965">brother</span> <span begin="13.965" end="14.115">played</span> <span begin="14.115" end="14.286">the</span> <span begin="14.286" end="14.591">guitar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">他给我递了支烟 那时他的弟弟在弹着吉他</span></p><p begin="14.723" end="17.046" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="14.723" end="14.807">She</span> <span begin="14.807" end="14.954">asked</span> <span begin="14.954" end="15.095">me,</span> <span begin="15.095" end="15.283">&quot;What</span> <span begin="15.283" end="15.373">does</span> <span begin="15.373" end="15.505">it</span> <span begin="15.505" end="15.913">mean,</span> <span begin="15.913" end="16.033">the</span> <span begin="16.033" end="16.321">Gaelic</span> <span begin="16.321" end="16.468">ink</span> <span begin="16.468" end="16.617">on</span> <span begin="16.617" end="16.797">your</span> <span begin="16.797" end="17.046">arm?&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她问我 你手臂上的盖尔语刺青是什么意思</span></p><p begin="17.102" end="19.316" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="17.102" end="17.205">Said</span> <span begin="17.205" end="17.306">it</span> <span begin="17.306" end="17.444">was</span> <span begin="17.444" end="17.609">one</span> <span begin="17.609" end="17.747">of</span> <span begin="17.747" end="17.873">my</span> <span begin="17.873" end="18.173">friend&apos;s</span> <span begin="18.173" end="18.515">songs,</span> <span begin="18.515" end="18.637">do</span> <span begin="18.637" end="18.733">you</span> <span begin="18.733" end="18.882">want</span> <span begin="18.882" end="18.954">to</span> <span begin="18.954" end="19.136">drink</span> <span begin="19.136" end="19.316">on?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我说这是我朋友的一首歌 你想要喝一杯吗</span></p><p begin="19.377" end="21.832" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.377" end="19.485">She</span> <span begin="19.485" end="19.861">took</span> <span begin="19.861" end="20.188">Jamie</span> <span begin="20.188" end="20.327">as</span> <span begin="20.327" end="20.443">a</span> <span begin="20.443" end="21.040">chaser,</span> <span begin="21.040" end="21.295">jack</span> <span begin="21.295" end="21.407">for</span> <span begin="21.407" end="21.532">the</span> <span begin="21.532" end="21.832">fun</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她酷爱喝Jamie威士忌 有时也喝些Jack的田纳西威士忌</span></p><p begin="21.940" end="24.568" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.940" end="22.059">She</span> <span begin="22.059" end="22.345">got</span> <span begin="22.345" end="22.615">Arthur</span> <span begin="22.615" end="22.735">on</span> <span begin="22.735" end="22.858">the</span> <span begin="22.858" end="23.119">table</span> <span begin="23.119" end="23.360">with</span> <span begin="23.360" end="23.621">Johnny</span> <span begin="23.621" end="23.957">riding</span> <span begin="23.957" end="24.103">as</span> <span begin="24.103" end="24.568">shotgun</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她把Arthur黑啤放在桌上 配上Johnny威士忌好似一把猎枪</span></p><p begin="24.876" end="26.620" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.876" end="25.149">Chatted</span> <span begin="25.149" end="25.305">some</span> <span begin="25.305" end="25.524">more,</span> <span begin="25.524" end="25.720">one</span> <span begin="25.720" end="25.872">more</span> <span begin="25.872" end="26.107">drink</span> <span begin="26.107" end="26.205">at</span> <span begin="26.205" end="26.364">the</span> <span begin="26.364" end="26.620">bar</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我们在那酒吧随意聊天 不停喝着酒</span></p><p begin="26.748" end="28.980" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.748" end="26.871">Then</span> <span begin="26.871" end="27.075">put</span> <span begin="27.075" end="27.222">Van</span> <span begin="27.222" end="27.363">on</span> <span begin="27.363" end="27.510">the</span> <span begin="27.510" end="28.140">jukebox,</span> <span begin="28.140" end="28.311">got</span> <span begin="28.311" end="28.467">up</span> <span begin="28.467" end="28.587">to</span> <span begin="28.587" end="28.980">dance</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">然后再点唱机放起范莫里森的歌 就开始跳起舞了</span></p></div><div begin="29.141" end="45.456" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="29.141" end="31.535" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="29.141" end="29.231">You</span> <span begin="29.231" end="29.367">know</span> <span begin="29.367" end="29.477">she</span> <span begin="29.477" end="29.720">played</span> <span begin="29.720" end="29.972">the</span> <span begin="29.972" end="30.296">fiddle</span> <span begin="30.296" end="30.519">in</span> <span begin="30.519" end="30.680">an</span> <span begin="30.680" end="31.247">Irish</span> <span begin="31.247" end="31.535">band</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她在爱尔兰乐队中演奏小提琴</span></p><p begin="31.599" end="33.877" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.599" end="31.687">But</span> <span begin="31.687" end="31.828">she</span> <span begin="31.828" end="32.083">fell</span> <span begin="32.083" end="32.329">in</span> <span begin="32.329" end="32.707">love</span> <span begin="32.707" end="32.913">with</span> <span begin="32.913" end="33.064">an</span> <span begin="33.064" end="33.601">English</span> <span begin="33.601" end="33.877">man</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">却与一个英国男人共谱恋曲</span></p><p begin="34.176" end="36.341" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="34.176" end="34.413">Kissed</span> <span begin="34.413" end="34.627">her</span> <span begin="34.627" end="34.771">on</span> <span begin="34.771" end="34.915">the</span> <span begin="34.915" end="35.044">neck</span> <span begin="35.044" end="35.143">and</span> <span begin="35.143" end="35.301">then</span> <span begin="35.301" end="35.421">I</span> <span begin="35.421" end="35.573">took</span> <span begin="35.573" end="35.727">her</span> <span begin="35.727" end="35.907">by</span> <span begin="35.907" end="36.036">the</span> <span begin="36.036" end="36.341">hand</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我亲吻着他的香颈 然后握住她的手</span></p><p begin="36.380" end="38.154" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="36.380" end="36.528">Said,</span> <span begin="36.528" end="36.933">&quot;Baby,</span> <span begin="36.933" end="37.116">I</span> <span begin="37.116" end="37.428">just</span> <span begin="37.428" end="37.872">wanna</span> <span begin="37.872" end="38.154">dance&quot;</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">说亲爱的我想要跳舞了</span></p><p begin="38.214" end="40.667" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.214" end="38.331">With</span> <span begin="38.331" end="38.502">my</span> <span begin="38.502" end="38.733">pretty</span> <span begin="38.733" end="39.048">little</span> <span begin="39.048" end="39.647">Gal</span><span begin="39.647" end="40.211">way</span> <span begin="40.211" end="40.667">girl</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">和我漂亮的戈尔韦女孩一起</span></p><p begin="42.906" end="45.456" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="42.906" end="43.113">You&apos;re</span> <span begin="43.113" end="43.251">my</span> <span begin="43.251" end="43.533">pretty</span> <span begin="43.533" end="43.872">little</span> <span begin="43.872" end="44.476">Gal</span><span begin="44.476" end="45.081">way</span> <span begin="45.081" end="45.456">girl</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">你就是我那漂亮的戈尔韦女孩儿</span></p></div><div begin="48.307" end="1:07.276" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="48.307" end="50.625" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="48.307" end="48.406">You</span> <span begin="48.406" end="48.490">know</span> <span begin="48.490" end="48.643">she</span> <span begin="48.643" end="48.881">beat</span> <span begin="48.881" end="49.018">me</span> <span begin="49.018" end="49.138">at</span> <span begin="49.138" end="49.481">darts</span> <span begin="49.481" end="49.633">and</span> <span begin="49.633" end="49.730">then</span> <span begin="49.730" end="49.880">she</span> <span begin="49.880" end="50.090">beat</span> <span begin="50.090" end="50.225">me</span> <span begin="50.225" end="50.345">at</span> <span begin="50.345" end="50.625">pool</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她在掷飞镖比赛和台球比赛都赢了我</span></p><p begin="50.724" end="53.048" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.724" end="50.817">And</span> <span begin="50.817" end="50.920">then</span> <span begin="50.920" end="51.057">she</span> <span begin="51.057" end="51.276">kissed</span> <span begin="51.276" end="51.379">me</span> <span begin="51.379" end="51.549">like</span> <span begin="51.549" end="51.693">there</span> <span begin="51.693" end="51.811">was</span> <span begin="51.811" end="52.207">nobody</span> <span begin="52.207" end="52.516">else</span> <span begin="52.516" end="52.628">in</span> <span begin="52.628" end="52.748">the</span> <span begin="52.748" end="53.048">room</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">她也会在那房间里旁若无人地吻着我</span></p><p begin="53.068" end="55.348" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.068" end="53.174">As</span> <span begin="53.174" end="53.383">last</span>